---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const etfs = [
  { name: 'Bitwise HYPE ETF', ticker: 'BHYP', status: 'US spot' },
  { name: '21Shares HYPE ETF', ticker: 'THYP', status: 'US spot' },
  { name: 'Grayscale HYPE', ticker: 'GHYP', status: 'Filing' },
];
---
<Layout title="Ecosystem" path="/ecosystem" description="The HYPE ecosystem — spot ETFs, structural demand, HIP-3 markets and where the token sits in the wider market.">
  <section class="wrap section">
    <span class="eyebrow">Ecosystem · HYPE</span>
    <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px)">Where HYPE plugs into the wider market.</h1>
    <p class="section-lede" style="font-size:17px">
      Beyond the protocol itself, HYPE has picked up the kind of external, structurally-additive demand most
      tokens never get: regulated US spot ETFs, a fee-funded buyback engine, and the AQAv2 reserve-yield flow.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:20px;margin:34px 0 16px">US spot ETFs</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {etfs.map((e) => (
        <div class="card card-hover">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
            <span class="stat-label">{e.status}</span>
            <span class="badge">{e.ticker}</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;margin-top:12px">{e.name}</h3>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="dim mono" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:10px">ETF availability and tickers change; confirm current status with the issuer before acting. Not investment advice.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:20px;margin:40px 0 16px">Structural context</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px">Fee buybacks</h3>
        <p class="mid" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.65">Roughly 97% of trading fees are recycled into HYPE via the Assistance Fund on an ongoing basis — demand sourced directly from real usage. <a href="/burns" style="color:var(--accent)">Buyback tracker →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-prism">
        <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px">AQAv2 reserve yield</h3>
        <p class="mid" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.65">Up to ~90% of yield on USDC held on Hyperliquid is returned to the protocol, adding an estimated $135–160M/yr of buyback fuel. <a href="/treasury" style="color:var(--accent)">Treasury detail →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:24px">
      <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px">HIP-3 builder markets</h3>
      <p class="mid" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.65">HIP-3 lets builders deploy their own perp markets on Hyperliquid — including pre-IPO equity perps for names like SpaceX, OpenAI and Anthropic. <a href="/hip3" style="color:var(--accent)">HIP-3 markets →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
